      "text": "Let's denote Jane's current age as \\( x \\). One year ago, her age was \\( x - 1 \\), and one year from now, her age will be \\( x + 1 \\).\n\nAccording to the problem, one year ago, her age was a perfect square:\n\\[ x - 1 = k^2 \\]\nwhere \\( k \\) is an integer.\n\nAnd one year from now, her age will be a perfect cube:\n\\[ x + 1 = m^3 \\]\nwhere \\( m \\) is an integer.\n\nWe need to find a value of \\( x \\) that satisfies both conditions. Let's start by expressing \\( x \\) in both equations:\n\\[ x = k^2 + 1 \\]\n\\[ x = m^3 - 1 \\]\n\nSince both expressions are equal to \\( x \\), we can set them equal to each other:\n\\[ k^2 + 1 = m^3 - 1 \\]\n\nNext, we rearrange the equation to solve for one of the variables:\n\\[ m^3 = k^2 + 2 \\]\n\nWe need to find integer values of \\( k \\) and \\( m \\) that satisfy this equation. Let's test some values for \\( k \\):\n\n1. If \\( k = 1 \\):\n   \\[ m^3 = 1^2 + 2 = 3 \\]\n   \\[ m = \\sqrt{3} \\]\n   Since \\( m \\) must be an integer, \\( k = 1 \\) is not a solution.\n\n2. If \\( k = 2 \\):\n   \\[ m^3 = 2^2 + 2 = 6 \\]\n   \\[ m = \\sqrt{6} \\]\n   Since \\( m \\) must be an integer, \\( k = 2 \\) is not a solution.\n\n3. If \\( k = 3 \\):\n   \\[ m^3 = 3^2 + 2 = 11 \\]\n   \\[ m = \\sqrt{11} \\]\n   Since \\( m \\) must be an integer, \\( k = 3 \\) is not a solution.\n\n4. If \\( k = 4 \\):\n   \\[ m^3 = 4^2 + 2 = 18 \\]\n   \\[ m = \\sqrt{18} \\]\n   Since \\( m \\) must be an integer, \\( k = 4 \\) is not a solution.\n\n5. If \\( k = 5 \\):\n   \\[ m^3 = 5^2 + 2 = 27 \\]\n   \\[ m = 3 \\]\n   Here, \\( m = 3 \\) is an integer, so \\( k = 5 \\) is a solution. Substituting \\( k = 5 \\) back into the equation \\( x = k^2 + 1 \\):\n   \\[ x = 5^2 + 1 = 25 + 1 = 26 \\]\n\nWe need to verify that \\( x = 26 \\) satisfies both conditions:\n- One year ago, Jane's age was \\( 26 - 1 = 25 \\), which is a perfect square.\n- One year from now, Jane's age will be \\( 26 + 1 = 27 \\), which is a perfect cube (since \\( 27 = 3^3 \\)).\n\nBoth conditions are satisfied, so Jane's current age is \\(\\boxed{26}\\).",
